---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Falling404 from '../components/physics/Falling404'
---
<BaseLayout title="404" noindex>
  <section class="not-found container">
    <Falling404 client:load />
    <p class="eyebrow">ERROR / LOST BODY</p>
    <h1>4<span>0</span>4</h1>
    <p>这个地址没有内容，或者页面已经被移除。</p>
    <div><a class="button" href="/">返回首页</a><a class="button" href="/search/">搜索内容</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .not-found { position: relative; min-height: 75vh; padding-block: 5rem; display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; overflow: hidden; }
  .not-found > :not(canvas) { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  h1 { margin: 1rem 0; font: 600 clamp(8rem, 30vw, 25rem)/.7 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.1em; }
  h1 span { display: inline-block; color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(.08em) rotate(8deg); }
  .not-found > p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); }
  .not-found div { margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: .75rem; }
</style>
